    "Name": "Little Brother",
    "Details": "The Little Brother LB-1X arms each arm with a light rifle fed by a total of three tons of ammunition, backed by a machine gun in each side torso with a ton of ammunition in the right torso. Eight tons of primitive armor cover the frame, and an IndustrialMech ejection seat gives the pilot an escape option.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Rugged</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.73</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Upper, Right Upper</color>",
